From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] cldapi: Cloud Files API, sync roots, placeholders, hydration (3627)

cldapi: the Cloud Files API (sync roots, placeholders, connections, hydration)

CfRegisterSyncRoot/Unregister keep sync roots under HKCU\...\Explorer\SyncRootManager.
CfConnectSyncRoot/Disconnect keep the provider's callback table per connection.
CfCreatePlaceholders, CfConvertToPlaceholder, CfUpdatePlaceholder, CfRevertPlaceholder,
CfSetInSyncState, CfSetPinState, CfGetPlaceholderInfo/RangeInfo keep the placeholder state in
a small file per placeholder under %LOCALAPPDATA%\Microsoft\CloudFiles (the file is sparse of
its logical size until hydrated). CfHydratePlaceholder calls the provider's FETCH_DATA
callback and CfExecute (TRANSFER_DATA with the documented 4 KB alignment rule, RETRIEVE_DATA,
TRANSFER_PLACEHOLDERS and the acknowledgements) fills the file. Hydration on open by a filter
driver is not available.
